{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And ten thousand talents of silver.</b> It is deficient, and so it is 'and ten thousand thousands of talents of silver,' like 'and the prophecy of Oded the prophet.'" "<b>The king's treasuries.</b> Storehouses, and like it 'after the king's treasures,' and the nun is inserted, and likewise 'and in the treasuries of Dumim.'"], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra reads ועשרת as construct, yielding 'ten thousand of'; the comparison is to II Chronicles 15:8, where והנבואה is similarly construct before a proper name."}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:53.543502625Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}